      "value": "<p>You have resilience and an unshakable spirit that can keep you standing through wounds that would be fatal to others. You gain the @Compendium[pf2e.feats-srd.I0BhPWqYf1bbzEYg]{Diehard}  general feat and gain a +1 circumstance bonus to all Recovery Checks.</p>\n<hr />\n<blockquote>\n<p>The recovered check bonus cannot be automated yet. Must be added manually.</p>\n</blockquote>"
